<main class="min-h-screen">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <div class="text-center mb-14">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-base-content mb-4">
        {gettext("Pricing")}
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto" style="color: var(--ink-2);">
        {gettext(
          "Stride is free to self-host, and free to use hosted for individuals and small teams. Organizations pay for the features larger teams need."
        )}
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div
        id="plan-free"
        class="bg-base-100 rounded-2xl shadow-md border border-base-300 p-8 flex flex-col"
      >
        <div class="mb-6">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-base-content mb-2">
            {gettext("Free")}
          </h2>
          <p style="color: var(--ink-2);">
            {gettext("For individuals and small teams. No card required.")}
          </p>
        </div>

        <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8 flex-1" style="color: var(--ink-2);">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <.icon name="hero-check" class="w-5 h-5 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            <span>{gettext("Unlimited boards, tasks and goals")}</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <.icon name="hero-check" class="w-5 h-5 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            <span>{gettext("Up to 3 people per board — AI agents do not count")}</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <.icon name="hero-check" class="w-5 h-5 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            <span>{gettext("Bring any agent — Claude, Gemini, OpenCode, Codex, your own")}</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <.icon name="hero-check" class="w-5 h-5 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            <span>{gettext("The full REST API and client-side hooks")}</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <.icon name="hero-check" class="w-5 h-5 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            <span>{gettext("Metrics and exports")}</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <.icon name="hero-check" class="w-5 h-5 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            <span>{gettext("Community support on GitHub")}</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <.icon name="hero-check" class="w-5 h-5 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            <span>
              <.with_channel
                text={gettext("Access to our Slack %{channel} channel", channel: "%{channel}")}
                channel="#stride-community"
              />
            </span>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <.link
          href={~p"/users/register"}
          class="block w-full text-center px-5 py-3 rounded-lg border-2 border-base-300 text-base-content font-semibold hover:bg-base-200 transition-colors"
        >
          {gettext("Get started")}
        </.link>
      </div>

      <div
        id="plan-organization"
        class="bg-base-100 rounded-2xl shadow-xl border-2 border-primary p-8 flex flex-col"
      >
        <div class="mb-6">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-base-content mb-2">
            {gettext("Organization")}
          </h2>
          <p style="color: var(--ink-2);">
            {gettext("For teams that need more.")}
          </p>
          <p id="organization-price" class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2">
            <span class="text-4xl font-bold text-base-content">{gettext("$12 CAD")}</span>
            <span style="color: var(--ink-2);">{gettext("per user / month")}</span>
          </p>
          <p id="organization-price-limit" class="mt-1 text-sm" style="color: var(--ink-2);">
            {gettext("For up to 250 users. More than 250? Contact us for pricing.")}
          </p>
        </div>

        <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8 flex-1" style="color: var(--ink-2);">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <.icon name="hero-check" class="w-5 h-5 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            <span>{gettext("Everything in Free, with no user or board limits, plus:")}</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <.icon name="hero-check" class="w-5 h-5 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            <span>{gettext("Notifications")}</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <.icon name="hero-check" class="w-5 h-5 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            <span>{gettext("Organization audit log")}</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <.icon name="hero-check" class="w-5 h-5 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            <span>{gettext("Single sign-on (SSO)")}</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <.icon name="hero-check" class="w-5 h-5 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            <span>{gettext("Workspaces")}</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <.icon name="hero-check" class="w-5 h-5 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            <span>{gettext("Bulk actions")}</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <.icon name="hero-check" class="w-5 h-5 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            <span>{gettext("Integrations (webhooks)")}</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <.icon name="hero-check" class="w-5 h-5 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            <span>{gettext("Task telemetry fields")}</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <.icon name="hero-check" class="w-5 h-5 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            <span>{gettext("MCP access")}</span>
          </li>
          <li id="organization-support" class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <.icon name="hero-check" class="w-5 h-5 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" />
            <span>
              {gettext(
                "Your own Slack support channel that only your organization can see, with a response to support questions within 24 hours"
              )}
              <span class="block mt-1 text-pretty">
                {gettext(
                  "For every 100 users, or part of 100, add 2 people to the channel. For example, 60 users get 2 people and 110 users get 4."
                )}
              </span>
            </span>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <a
          href="mailto:enterprise@letstango.ca"
          class="block w-full text-center px-5 py-3 rounded-lg bg-primary text-primary-content font-semibold hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity"
        >
          {gettext("Talk to us")}
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section
      id="contact"
      class="max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 bg-base-100 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 p-8 text-center scroll-mt-24"
    >
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-base-content mb-3">
        {gettext("Get Stride for your organization")}
      </h2>
      <p class="mb-6 leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-2);">
        {gettext(
          "The Organization plan is set up with you directly. Email us about your team and we will reply with next steps. For more than 250 users, we will send you a price."
        )}
      </p>
      <a
        href="mailto:enterprise@letstango.ca"
        class="inline-block px-6 py-3 rounded-lg bg-primary text-primary-content font-semibold hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity"
      >
        {gettext("Talk to us")}
      </a>
    </section>

    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-base-content mb-6 text-center">
        {gettext("Frequently asked questions")}
      </h2>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <details class="bg-base-100 rounded-xl border border-base-300 p-5 cursor-pointer">
          <summary class="font-semibold text-base-content">
            {gettext("Is Stride really free if I self-host?")}
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-2);">
            {gettext(
              "Yes. The whole codebase is open source under the MIT license. Run it on your own machine, your own server, or your own Kubernetes cluster. You owe us nothing."
            )}
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="bg-base-100 rounded-xl border border-base-300 p-5 cursor-pointer">
          <summary class="font-semibold text-base-content">
            {gettext("Who counts toward the 3-person limit on a free board?")}
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-2);">
            {gettext(
              "Only the human members of the board, including its owner. Agents — Claude, Gemini, OpenCode, Codex, your own — never count. They authenticate via API tokens scoped to a board and a user, and there is no per-agent fee. Boards in an Organization have no member limit."
            )}
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="bg-base-100 rounded-xl border border-base-300 p-5 cursor-pointer">
          <summary class="font-semibold text-base-content">
            {gettext("Can I switch between self-hosted and hosted later?")}
          </summary>
          <p id="faq-switch-hosting" class="mt-3 leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-2);">
            {gettext(
              "Yes, both ways, and the data model is the same. An Organization's org-admins export a workspace from its workspace settings, and we import it on the other side. On the free plan, email "
            )}<a
              href="mailto:enterprise@letstango.ca"
              class="text-[var(--ink)] hover:text-[var(--stride-orange)] underline font-medium"
            >enterprise@letstango.ca</a>{gettext(" and we will help you move.")}
          </p>
        </details>

        <details class="bg-base-100 rounded-xl border border-base-300 p-5 cursor-pointer">
          <summary class="font-semibold text-base-content">
            {gettext("Do you offer a discount for non-profits or open-source projects?")}
          </summary>
          <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--ink-2);">
            {gettext("Yes. Email ")}<a
              href="mailto:enterprise@letstango.ca"
              class="text-[var(--ink)] hover:text-[var(--stride-orange)] underline font-medium"
            >enterprise@letstango.ca</a>{gettext(
              " with a short note about your project and we will set you up."
            )}
          </p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
